OL,3,GNEWSACalls for vaping to be banned
OL,4,Ainside venues
OL,5,
OL,6,FVaping in and around Guernsey venues
OL,7,Fshould be restricted, according to
OL,8,Fislanders with health conditions and
OL,9,Flocal organisations.
OL,11,FSmoking in most indoor places such as
OL,12,Frestaurants and bars was made illegal
OL,13,Fin 2005, although this does not extend
OL,14,Fto vaping, which is at the business's
OL,15,Fdiscretion.
OL,17,FGlen Tonks, chair of Cystic Fibrosis
OL,18,FGuernsey, said people with the lung
OL,19,Fcondition it helped had to avoid
OL,20,Fsecond-hand vapour "like the plague."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
